{"id":"rettung","lemma":"Rettung","pos":"noun","rank":2492,"glosses":["rescue","rescue service; emergency service","ambulance"],"ipa":"/ˈʁɛtʊŋ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/35/De-Rettung.ogg/De-Rettung.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Rettung","plural":"Rettungen"},"examples":[{"text":"Sind Sie zu meiner Rettung gekommen?","en":"Have you come to save me?","words":[{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null,{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"}]},{"text":"Die Rettung kam sofort.","en":"The ambulance arrived right away.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"immediately, at once"}]},{"text":"Die Rettung kam, gleich nachdem wir angerufen hatten.","en":"The ambulance arrived soon after we called.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"alike"},{"g":"after"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"to call, to ring","l":"anrufen"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"}]},{"text":"Sie sind offensichtlich nicht an Ihrer Rettung interessiert.","en":"You obviously have no interest in saving yourself.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"obvious"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"at / on"},{"g":"she","l":"sie"},null,{"g":"interested"}]},{"text":"Tom war unsere Rettung.","en":"Tom saved the day.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/391109","words":[null,{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"our","l":"unser"},null]}]}